{#
    A document of somebody else's, shown inside this one — a player, or a
    specimen card.

    Neither fits in a file of text, so what remains is where it is. The
    specimen names the size of its measurement because that is what the card
    is evidence for. A card is not a document of the site and has no twin of
    its own. It is a render, and this is the one link in a twin that lands on
    a page.
#}
{%- autoescape false -%}
{%- if node.hasOption('specimen') -%}
[{{ node.option('title')|default('Specimen')|md_escape }} · {{ node.option('viewport') }}]({{ asset(node.url) }})
{% else -%}
[{{ node.option('title')|default(node.url)|md_escape }}]({{ node.url }})
{% endif -%}
{%- endautoescape -%}
